{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47711","headline":"题院诗 · 侯道华","name":"题院诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帖里大还丹，多年色不移。\n前宵盗吃却，今日碧空飞。\n慙媿深珍重，珍重邓天师。\n他年炼得药，留着与内芝。\n吾师知此术，速炼莫爲迟。\n三清专相待，大罗的有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"侯道华","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}